Package: CleanMatch
Type: Package
Title: CleanMatch
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Michał Kazimierczak
Maintainer: The package maintainer <michal.kazimierczak@euipo.europa.eu>
Description: Normalises company names from different data sources (legal forms, 'trading as' phrases,
    transliteration, cities, postal codes), matches them and scores the candidate matches.
